OL,3,AUK economy grows at fastest rate in
OL,4,Amore than two years, boosted by AI
OL,5,Ainvestment
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK economy grew by 0.7% from July
OL,8,Fto September, the fastest rate for two
OL,9,Fyears
OL,11,FThe growth was "almost entirely due to
OL,12,Fstrong and widespread growth in the
OL,13,Fservices sector", says the chief
OL,14,Feconomist at the Office for National
OL,15,FStatistics
OL,17,FWithin the service sector, computer
OL,18,Fprogramming increased strongly, the ONS
OL,19,Fsays, as well as "AI-linked businesses"
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
