OL,3,ABurnham says climate consensus 'gone'
OL,4,Aand pledges 'new era of British
OL,5,Aleadership' in COP31 speech
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham has been speaking at the
OL,8,FCOP31 climate conference in Antalya,
OL,9,FTurkey, where leaders are continuing to
OL,10,Faddress delegates on the fourth day of
OL,11,Fthe summit - you can watch live above
OL,13,FThe UK prime minister pledged a "new
OL,14,Fera of British leadership" on climate,
OL,15,Fsaying the "consensus we once enjoyed"
OL,16,Fon the issue had gone and the "reality"
OL,17,Fis the world will reach 1.5C
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
