OL,3,ANew York building collapse kills at
OL,4,Aleast two, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least two people have died and more
OL,7,Fthan 17 others are injured after a
OL,8,Fbuilding in New York City collapsed
OL,9,Finto an open construction site,
OL,10,Fofficials have said.
OL,12,FIt sparked a massive search-and-rescue
OL,13,Foperation, with more than 250 first
OL,14,Fresponders at the scene in Brooklyn,
OL,15,Ftrying to find survivors who may have
OL,16,Fbeen trapped under the rubble of the
OL,17,Fthree-storey building.
OL,19,FHours later, aerial video showed
OL,20,Ffirefighters pulling a survivor,
OL,21,Fcovered in dust, out of the debris on a
OL,22,Fstretcher.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
