OL,3,ADemocrat Scott Colom makes history as
OL,4,AMississippi elects first black senator
OL,5,Ain 150 years
OL,6,
OL,7,FDemocrat Scott Colom has won the US
OL,8,FSenate race in Mississippi, delivering
OL,9,Fa shock victory for the party in a
OL,10,Fdeeply conservative state that has
OL,11,Felected Republicans for decades.
OL,13,FColom's victory makes him the first
OL,14,Fblack person from Mississippi to be
OL,15,Felected to the US Senate since 1874.
OL,17,FFewer than five thousand votes out of
OL,18,Fnearly a million counted separated him
OL,19,Ffrom his Republican opponent, the
OL,20,Fincumbent Cindy Hyde-Smith.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
